  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid knowing your team is void in [♣] (ruffing every [♣] lead) and long in [♦]; it shapes how to bid and what to lead.",
    "opponent": "Revealed when a partner trumps a [♣] trick or shows unexpected [♦] length.",
    "rationale": "Seed-become-heart (random four cards) measured −15 because it hits trumps and honors; a deterministic, side-suit-only change keeps every [♠] and guarantees a team void, which has standalone ruffing value before any payoff. Duplicate identities are already handled for synthetic cards.",
