      "seed-trump-points"
    ],
    "cluster": "A",
    "draftText": "Opening: Every [♣] your team holds becomes a [♦]",
    "hooks": "Become with an optional source filter (\"from\"), where an omitted count means every matching card your team holds; resolves in the existing Opening window.",
    "critic": {
      "verdict": "keep",
      "concerns": "Guaranteed team [♣] void is a strong, memorable enabler; duplicate identities (two [K♦]) need a tie-break players can see, and the Nil tag is a stretch.",
